'''Sudowoodo''' (Japanese: '''ウソッキー''' ''Usokkie'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

