==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Unseen Forces|Sudowoodo|15}} from the {{TCG|EX Unseen Forces}} expansion.
*'''Fighting Headbutt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Lost Origin|Falinks|110}} from the {{TCG|Lost Origin}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

